# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation with the dual list at constant
# pressure (D245, #270): Python -> `mdir run --continue` and
# `mdir run` -> Python without a note, and Python with the dual list ->
# Python with one list and with the matrix, a change of execution that a
# note names. The state at the end is that of the run that did not stop
# within what two runs differ by. Inputs/python_groups.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t checkpoints Double | FileCheck %s -DP=Double
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t checkpoints Mixed | FileCheck %s -DP=Mixed
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run --continue with the dual list
# CHECK: mdir run -> Python with the dual list, without a note
# CHECK: Python with the dual list -> Python with one list, and with the matrix: a note
# CHECK: checkpoints [[P]] passed
